      considerations: [
        'Score points by making the ends of the cross-shaped layout match; first player to reach 100 points wins the game.',
        'One player leads a double as the spinner. Players must complete all four arms of the spinner before adding tiles to them. On your turn you may play a matching tile or draw from the boneyard until you can play or it is empty; if you can neither play nor draw, pass. Play until someone empties their hand (dominoes) or the game blocks.',
        'First double led is the spinner; all arms must be started before adding to any arm.',
        'Draw from boneyard when unable to play; pass when unable to play and unable to draw.',
